{"id": "9th-u8-q003", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "unesco-award-socrates", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "1970-ஆம் ஆண்டு ஜூன் 27-ல் யுனெஸ்கோ (UNESCO) மன்றம் தந்தை பெரியாருக்கு வழங்கிய சர்வதேசப் பாராட்டுப் பட்டம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இந்தியாவின் விடிவெள்ளி", "B": "ஆசியாவின் ஒளி", "C": "தெற்கு ஆசியாவின் சாக்ரடீஸ்", "D": "உலக அமைதித் தூதர்"}, "explanation": "1970 ஜூன் 27-இல் யுனெஸ்கோ நிறுவனம் தந்தை பெரியாரைப் பாராட்டி 'தெற்கு ஆசியாவின் சாக்ரடீஸ்' (Socrates of South Asia) என்ற பட்டத்தை வழங்கிச் சிறப்பித்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which international title of distinction was conferred upon Thanthai Periyar by UNESCO on June 27, 1970?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Morning Star of India", "B": "Light of Asia", "C": "Socrates of South Asia (தெற்கு ஆசியாவின் சாக்ரடீஸ்)", "D": "Ambassador of World Peace"}, "explanation": "UNESCO honored Periyar on June 27, 1970, citing him as the 'Socrates of South Asia, prophet of the new age, and father of the social reform movement'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "c