{"id": "9th-u8-q012", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "periyar-thirukkural-views", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பழைய சமய இலக்கியங்களை விமர்சித்த பெரியார், எந்த நூலில் அறிவியல் கருத்துகளும் தத்துவக் கருத்துகளும் நிறைந்திருப்பதாகப் பெரிதும் போற்றினார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நாலடியார்", "B": "நான்மணிக்கடிகை", "C": "திரிகடுகம்", "D": "திருக்குறள்"}, "explanation": "'திருக்குறளில் அறிவியல் கருத்துகளும் தத்துவக் கருத்துகளும் அனைவருக்கும் பொதுவான இயற்கையறிவும் நிரம்பியுள்ளன' என்று கூறி பெரியார் திருக்குறள் மாநாடுகளை நடத்தினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Despite critiquing mythological orthodoxies, which classical secular work did Periyar venerate for its scientific, humanistic philosophy?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Naladiyar", "B": "Nanmanikkadikai", "C": "Thirigadugam", "D": "Thirukkural (திருக்குறள்)"}, "explanation": "Periyar championed Thirukkural as a rational, universal code of secular human ethics and organized Thirukkural conferences."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 156, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 156", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "periyar", "thirukkural"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q013", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "self-respect-marriage", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆடம்பரச் சடங்குகள், வீண் செலவுகள் மற்றும் புரோகிதர் மந்திரங்கள் இல்லாமல் பெரியார் அறிமுகப்படுத்திய திருமண முறை எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சுயமரியாதைத் திருமணம்", "B": "கலப்புத் திருமணம் மட்டுமே", "C": "சாதித் திருமணம்", "D": "வேதத் திருமணம்"}, "explanation": "புரோகிதர் இன்றி, ஆடம்பரச் செலவுகள் இன்றி, தாலி கட்டும் வழக்கத்தையும் மறுத்து எளிமையாக உறுதிமொழி ஏற்கும் 'சுயமரியாதைத் திருமண முறையை'ப் பெரியார் உருவாக்கினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which progressive matrimonial system free from priestly rituals, Sanskrit mantras, and wasteful extravagance was instituted by Periyar?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Self-Respect Marriage (சுயமரியாதைத் திருமணம்)", "B": "Inter-caste wedding only", "C": "Caste wedding", "D": "Vedic marriage"}, "explanation": "Periyar introduced the Self-Respect Marriage system based on mutual pledge, equality, and rationalist simplicity."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 156, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 156", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "periyar", "self_respect_marriage"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q014", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "reservation-education-jobs", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கல்வியிலும் வேலைவாய்ப்பிலும் அனைத்துச் சமூக மக்களுக்கும் மக்கள் தொகை விகிதாச்சாரத்திற்கு ஏற்ப அளிக்கப்பட வேண்டும் எனப் பெரியார் போராடியது எதற்காக?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இலவச வீடு", "B": "வகுப்புவாரி இட ஒதுக்கீடு (Communal Reservation)", "C": "இலவச நிலம்", "D": "அரசு மானியம்"}, "explanation": "ஒடுக்கப்பட்ட, பிற்படுத்தப்பட்ட மக்கள் சமூகத்தில் முன்னேறக் கல்வியிலும் வேலைவாய்ப்பிலும் 'வகுப்புவாரி இட ஒதுக்கீடு' (இடப்பங்கீடு) வேண்டும் எனப் பெரியார் அரும்பாடுபட்டார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What affirmative action policy did Periyar relentlessly fight for to secure proportionate representation for backward and depressed communities?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Free housing", "B": "Communal Reservation / Quota system (வகுப்புவாரி இட ஒதுக்கீடு)", "C": "Free farmland", "D": "Subsidies"}, "explanation": "Periyar led massive agitations to enshrine communal reservation in education and public employment."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and