{"id": "9th-u8-q072", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pitchamurthi-lao-tzu-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (கவிஞர்கள் - சிறப்புப் பெயர்கள்/நூல்கள்):\n(a) ந. பிச்சமூர்த்தி - 1. தாவோ தே ஜிங்\n(b) லா வோட்சு - 2. மொழிபெயர்ப்பாளர்\n(c) சி. மணி - 3. காட்டுவாத்து, லயம்\n(d) ரேவதி - 4. ந. பிச்சமூர்த்தியின் புனைப்பெயர்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-2, (c)-1, (d)-3", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-1, (c)-2, (d)-4"}, "explanation": "ந. பிச்சமூர்த்தி = காட்டுவாத்து, லயம் (3); லா வோட்சு = தாவோ தே ஜிங் (1); சி. மணி = தாவோ தே ஜிங் மொழிபெயர்ப்பாளர் (2); ரேவதி = ந. பிச்சமூர்த்தியின் புனைப்பெயர் (4). சரியான வரிசை: 3, 1, 2, 4."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the literary figures with their respective works and designations:\n(a) Na. Pitchamurthi - 1. Tao Te Ching\n(b) Lao Tzu - 2. Translator\n(c) C. Mani - 3. Kaattuvaathu, Layam\n(d) Revathi - 4. Pseudonym of Pitchamurthi", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-2, (c)-1, (d)-3", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-1, (c)-2, (d)-4"}, "explanation": "Pitchamurthi -> Kaattuvaathu (3); Lao Tzu -> Tao Te Ching (1); C. Mani -> Translator (2); Revathi -> Pen name (4). Sequence: 3, 1, 2, 4."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 168, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 168", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "matching", "pitchamurthi_lao_tzu"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q073", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tao-te-ching-room-walls", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "லா வோட்சுவின் கவிதையில், 'சுவர்களை எழுப்பி நாம் ஓர் அறையை உருவாக்குகிறோம்; ஆனால் அந்த அறை எதனால் வாழப் பயன்படுகிறது?' என்று விவரிக்கிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சுவர்களுக்கு இடையே உள்ள வெற்றிடத்தினால்", "B": "சுவர்களின் உயரத்தினால்", "C": "சுவர்களில் பூசிய சுண்ணாம்பினால்", "D": "கதவுகளின் மரத்தினால்"}, "explanation": "'சுவர்களைக் கொண்டு அறை அமைக்கப்படுகிறது; ஆயினும் உள்ளிருக்கும் வெற்றிடமே மனிதன் அந்த அறையில் வாழ உதவுகிறது' என லா வோட்சு கூறுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Lao Tzu's poem, walls are erected to construct a room; what enables humans to inhabit and use it?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "The vacant emptiness enclosed between the walls (உள்ளிருக்கும் வெற்றிடம்)", "B": "The height of the masonry", "C": "The paint on the walls", "D": "The timber of the doorway"}, "explanation": "Walls enclose the perimeter, but human dwelling occurs within the empty void inside."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 169, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 169", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "tao_te_ching", "room_metaphor"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q074", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "free-verse-characteristics", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "யாப்பிலக்கணக் கட்டுகளுக்கு உட்படாமல், உணர்ச்சிக்கும் கருத்துக்கும் முதன்மை தந்து எழுதப்படும் கவிதை வடிவம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வெண்பா", "B": "புதுக்கவிதை", "C": "கலிவெண்பா", "D": "வஞ்சிப்பா"}, "explanation": "யாப்பின் மரபு விதிகளைத் தளர்த்தி, சொற்களின் அணிவகுப்பை விடக் கருத்தின் ஆழத்திற்கும் உணர்ச்சிக்கும் முன்னுரிமை அளித்து எழுதப்படுவதே 'புதுக்கவிதை' (Modern Free Verse) ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which poetic form privileges emotional resonance and ideational clarity over classical rigid metrical rules?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Venba", "B": "Pudhukkavithai (புதுக்கவிதை - Modern Free Verse)", "C": "Kalivenba", "D": "Vanjippa"}, "explanation": "Pudhukkavithai transcends classical prosody to articulate direct emotional and philosophical truth."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 168, "chapter": null, "section": nul