{"id": "9th-u8-q095", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "letter-to-son-author", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'மகனுக்கு எழுதிய கடிதம்' என்னும் விரிவானப் பகுதியின் ஆசிரியர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வைரமுத்து", "B": "கண்ணதாசன்", "C": "கவிஞர் நா. முத்துக்குமார்", "D": "வாலி"}, "explanation": "'மகனுக்கு எழுதிய கடிதம்' என்ற உள்ளத்தை உருக்கும் அன்பு மடலை எழுதியவர் புகழ்பெற்ற பாடலாசிரியர் கவிஞர் நா. முத்துக்குமார் ஆவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who penned the evocative supplementary prose piece 'Letter to My Son' (மகனுக்கு எழுதிய கடிதம்)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vairamuthu", "B": "Kannadasan", "C": "Poet Na. Muthukumar (கவிஞர் நா. முத்துக்குமார்)", "D": "Vaali"}, "explanation": "Poet and lyricist Na. Muthukumar authored the touching paternal letter to his young son."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 161, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 161", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "muthukumar", "letter"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q096", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "muthukumar-national-awards", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கவிஞர் நா. முத்துக்குமார் சிறந்த திரைப்படப் பாடலாசிரியருக்கான இந்திய தேசிய விருதினை எத்தனை முறை வென்றுள்ளார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஒரு முறை", "B": "மூன்று முறை", "C": "நான்கு முறை", "D": "இரண்டு முறை ('தங்க மீன்கள்', 'சைவம்')"}, "explanation": "கவிஞர் நா. முத்துக்குமார் 'தங்க மீன்கள்' (ஆனந்த யாழை மீட்டுகிறாய்) மற்றும் 'சைவம்' (அழகே அழகே) ஆகிய திரைப்படப் பாடல்களுக்காக இருமுறை தேசிய விருது பெற்றார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How many times was lyricist-poet Na. Muthukumar conferred the prestigious National Film Award for Best Lyricist?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Once", "B": "Three times", "C": "Four times", "D": "Twice (இரண்டு முறை - 'Thanga Meengal' and 'Saivam')"}, "explanation": "He won the National Film Award for Best Lyricist twice for 'Thanga Meengal' and 'Saivam'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 161, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 161", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "muthukumar", "national_awards"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q097", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "muthukumar-books-quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"புத்தகங்களை நேசி. ஒரு புத்தகத்தைத் தொடுகிறபோது நீ ஓர் அனுபவத்தைத் தொடுவாய்... உன் உதிரத்திலும் அந்தக் காகித நதி ஓடிக்கொண்டே இருக்கட்டும்\" - என்று மகனுக்கு அறிவுறுத்தியவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நா. முத்துக்குமார்", "B": "அறிஞர் அண்ணா", "C": "அப்துல் கலாம்", "D": "ஜெயகாந்தன்"}, "explanation": "கவிஞர் நா. முத்துக்குமார் தன் மகனுக்கு எழுதிய கடிதத்தில் புத்தக வாசிப்பின் முக்கியத்துவத்தை 'உன் உதிரத்திலும் அந்தக் காகித நதி ஓடிக்கொண்டே இருக்கட்டும்' என நயம்படக் கூறியுள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"Love books. When you touch a book, you touch a living experience... let that river of paper flow eternally in your veins\" - Who gave this advice to his son?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Na. Muthukumar (நா. முத்துக்குமார்)", "B": "Arignar Anna", "C": "Abdul Kalam", "D": "Jayakanthan"}, "explanation": "Poet Na. Muthukumar penned these memorable lines celebrating the profound transformative power of reading."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 163, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 163", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "muthukumar", "books_quote"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q098", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "muthukumar-job-advice", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "எதிர்கால வேலைவாய்ப்பு குறித்து நா. முத்துக்குமார் தன் மகனுக்குக் கூறும் வாழ்க்கைப் பாடம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அதிக வருமானம் தரும் வேலையை மட்டுமே செய்", "B": "கிடைத்த வேலையை விட, பிடித்த வேலையைச் செய்", "C": "வெளிநாட்டு நிறுவனங்களில் மட்டுமே பணியாற்று", "D": "வேலையே செய்யாமல் ஓய்வெடு"}, "explanation": "பாடநூலில்: 'கிடைத்த வேலையை விட, பிடித்த வேலையைச் செய். இனிய இல்லறம் தொடங்கு' என்று நா. முத்துக்குமார் தம் மகனுக்கு அறிவுரை கூறுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What practical career philosophy does Na. Muthukumar impart to his son regarding future vocation?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Pursue only jobs yielding exorbitant salaries", "B": "Do the work you love, rather than merely settling for the job you get (கிடைத்த வேலையை விட, பிடித்த வேலையைச் செய்)", "C": "Work exclusively in overseas corporations", "D": "Remain idle without working"}, "explanation": "He counsels his son to follow his passion and do what he loves rather than merely accepting whatever job comes by."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 163, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 163", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "muthukumar", "vocation_advice"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q099", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "muthukumar-friendship-value", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மண்ணில் உள்ள அனைத்து உறவுகளையும் விட மேன்மையான உறவாக நா. முத்துக்குமார் குறிப்பிடுவது எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தொழில் உறவு", "B": "பண உறவு", "C": "நட்பு", "D": "பங்காளி உறவு"}, "explanation": "'இந்த மண்ணில் எல்லா உறவுகளையும் விட மேன்மையானது நட்பு மட்டுமே. நல்ல நண்பர்களைச் சேர்த்துக்கொள். உன் வாழ்க்கை நேராகும்' என்கிறார் நா. முத்துக்குமார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Above all human relationships on earth, which bond does Na. Muthukumar exalt as supreme?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Business association", "B": "Financial transaction", "C": "Friendship (நட்பு)", "D": "Property kinship"}, "explanation": "He counsels his son that genuine friendship is the noblest, most elevated human relationship on earth."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 163, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 163", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "muthukumar", "friendship"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q100", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "muthukumar-thoor-poem", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடநூலில் நா. முத்துக்குமாரின் கடிதத்தைத் தொடர்ந்து இடம்பெற்றுள்ள புகழ்பெற்ற கவிதை எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "காட்டுவாத்து", "B": "பச்சைக்கிளி", "C": "வானம்பாடி", "D": "தூர்"}, "explanation": "'வேப்பம்பூ மிதக்கும் எங்கள் வீட்டுக் கிணற்றில் தூர் வாரும் உற்சவம்... கடைசிவரை அப்பாவும் மறந்தே போனார் மனசுக்குள் தூரெடுக்க' என்ற நா. முத்துக்குமாரின் 'தூர்' கவிதை இடம்பெற்றுள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which poignant poem by Na. Muthukumar on family emotions and unexpressed feelings is appended to the lesson?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kaattuvaathu", "B": "Pachaikkili", "C": "Vaanambaadi", "D": "Thoor (தூர் - Desilting the Well)"}, "explanation": "'Thoor', depicting a rural well desilting festival while symbolizing unexpressed emotional burdens, is featured."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 163, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 163", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "muthukumar", "thoor_poem"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q101", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thoor-poem-inner-meaning", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'தூர்' கவிதையில் 'கடைசிவரை அப்பாவும் மறந்தே போனார் மனசுக்குள் தூரெடுக்க' என்ற வரிகள் எதனை உணர்த்துகின்றன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கிணற்றின் சேற்றை எடுத்த தந்தை, தன் உள்ளத்தில் தேங்கியிருந்த வருத்தங்களையும் சுமைகளையும் மற்றவர்களிடம் வெளிப்படுத்தாமல் மறைத்து வாழ்ந்ததை", "B": "கிணற்றை வெட்டியதை", "C": "தண்ணீர் இறைத்ததை", "D": "மழை பெய்ததை"}, "explanation": "குடும்பத்தின் சுமைக்காக உழைத்த தந்தை, வீணான சேற்றைக் கிணற்றிலிருந்து அள்ளியதைப் போல, தன் மனதிற்குள் தேங்கியிருந்த மனக்கசப்புகளையும் வலிகளையும் யாருக்கும் சொல்லாமல் சுமந்து வாழ்ந்ததை உணர்த்துகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What subtle emotional pathos do the lines 'Till the very end father forgot to desilt the silt within his heart' evoke?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "While diligently desilting the domestic well, the stoic father silently concealed his deep inner anxieties and sorrow", "B": "Digging the well", "C": "Drawing water", "D": "Rains falling"}, "explanation": "It symbolizes the silent self-sacrificing father who desilted the household well but bore his emotional sorrows silently within."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 163, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 163", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "muthukumar", "thoor_interpretation"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q102", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "muthukumar-generation-progress", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நா. முத்துக்குமார் தன் குடும்பத் தலைமுறைகளின் உழைப்பைப் பட்டியலிடும் போது, 'என் முப்பாட்டன் காடு திருத்தினான்... என் தகப்பன் விதை விதைத்தான்; நீ எதைச் செய்து கொண்டிருக்கிறாய்?' எனக் கூறுகிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "விதை நடுகிறாய்", "B": "அறுவடை செய்து கொண்டிருக்கிறாய்", "C": "நீர் ஊற்றுகிறாய்", "D": "காடு அழிக்கிறாய்"}, "explanation": "'என் முப்பாட்டன் காடு திருத்தினான். என் பாட்டன் கழனி அமைத்தான். என் தகப்பன் விதை விதைத்தான். உன் தகப்பன் நீர் ஊற்றினான். நீ அறுவடை செய்துகொண்டு இருக்கிறாய்' என்று தலைமுறை முன்னேற்றத்தை விவரிக்கிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In chronicling ancestral intergenerational toil, how does Na. Muthukumar describe his son's privileged epoch?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Sowing the seeds", "B": "Reaping the bountiful harvest (நீ அறுவடை செய்து கொண்டு இருக்கிறாய்)", "C": "Watering fields", "D": "Clearing forests"}, "explanation": "He reminds his son that each ancestor cleared, ploughed, and watered the fields so that he could reap the harvest."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 162, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 162", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "muthukumar", "generations"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q103", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "muthukumar-native-district", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கவிஞர் நா. முத்துக்குமார் பிறந்த ஊர் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மதுரை", "B": "ஈரோடு", "C": "காஞ்சிபுரம் (கன்னிகாபுரம்)", "D": "தஞ்சாவூர்"}, "explanation": "கவிஞர் நா. முத்துக்குமார் காஞ்சிபுரம் மாவட்டம் கன்னிகாபுரத்தில் 1975 ஜூலை 12 அன்று பிறந்தார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the native birthplace of poet-lyricist Na. Muthukumar?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Madurai", "B": "Erode", "C": "Kanchipuram (Kannikapuram - காஞ்சிபுரம்)", "D": "Thanjavur"}, "explanation": "Na. Muthukumar was born in Kannikapuram in Kanchipuram district."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 161, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 161", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "muthukumar", "birthplace"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q104", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "yasodhara-vocabulary-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (யசோதர காவியச் சொற்கள் - பொருள்கள்):\n(a) அறம் - 1. சினம்\n(b) வெகுளி - 2. அறிவு\n(c) ஞானம் - 3. மேற்கொண்ட நன்னெறி\n(d) விரதம் - 4. நற்செயல்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-4, (c)-3, (d)-2", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-1, (d)-4", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-2, (c)-4, (d)-1", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-1, (c)-2, (d)-3"}, "explanation": "அறம் = நற்செயல் (4); வெகுளி = சினம் (1); ஞானம் = அறிவு (2); விரதம் = மேற்கொண்ட நன்னெறி (3). சரியான வரிசை: 4, 1, 2, 3."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the ethical vocabulary terms from Yasodhara Kaaviyam with their meanings:\n(a) Aram - 1. Anger / Wrath\n(b) Veguli - 2. Wisdom / Knowledge\n(c) Gnaanam - 3. Moral vow\n(d) Viratham - 4. Righteous deed", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-4, (c)-3, (d)-2", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-1, (d)-4", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-2, (c)-4, (d)-1", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-1, (c)-2, (d)-3"}, "explanation": "Aram -> Righteous deed (4); Veguli -> Anger (1); Gnaanam -> Wisdom (2); Viratham -> Moral vow (3). Sequence: 4, 1, 2, 3."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_n