{"id": "9th-u8-q111", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "yasodhara-didactic-message", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "யசோதர காவியம் வலியுறுத்தும் முதன்மையான அறநெறி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "யாகங்கள் செய்தல்", "B": "போர் தொடுத்தல்", "C": "கொல்லாமை (உயிர்க்கொலை செய்யாமை)", "D": "தவம் செய்தல் மட்டுமே"}, "explanation": "யசோதர காவியம் மாவாலான கோழியை அரிந்து பலியிட்ட பாவமே பல பிறவிகளில் துன்பத்தைத் தந்தது எனக் கூறி 'உயிர்க்கொலை செய்யாமை' (கொல்லாமை) என்ற அறத்தை வலியுறுத்துகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What cardinal ethical tenet is foremost highlighted in the narrative of Yasodhara Kaaviyam?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Animal sacrifice rituals", "B": "Imperial conquests", "C": "Non-killing / Ahimsa (கொல்லாமை)", "D": "Austerity only"}, "explanation": "The epic illustrates that even symbolic animal sacrifice carries grave karmic retributions, upholding strict Ahimsa (non-killing)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 160, "chapter": null, "section":