{"id": "9th-u8-q119", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "orasai-seer-vaaypaadu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (வெண்பாவின் ஈற்றுச் சீர் வாய்பாடுகள்):\n(a) நேர் - 1. பிறப்பு\n(b) நிரை - 2. காசு\n(c) நேர்பு - 3. மலர்\n(d) நிரைபு - 4. நாள்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3", "B": "(a)-1, (b)-4, (c)-3, (d)-2", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-2, (c)-1, (d)-4"}, "explanation": "நேர் = நாள் (4); நிரை = மலர் (3); நேர்பு = காசு (2); நிரைபு = பிறப்பு (1). சரியான வரிசை: 4, 3, 2, 1."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the terminal monosyllabic foot formulas of a Venba stanza with their mnemonic names:\n(a) Ner - 1. Pirappu\n(b) Nirai - 2. Kaasu\n(c) Nerbu - 3. Malar\n(d) Niraibu - 4. Naal", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3", "B": "(a)-1, (b)-4, (c)-3, (d)-2", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-2, (c)-1, (d)-4"}, "explanation": "Ner -> Naal (4); Nirai -> Malar (3); Nerbu -> Kaasu (2); Niraibu -> Pirappu (1). Sequence: 4, 3, 2, 1."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational