{"id": "9th-u8-q121", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "eerasai-seer-vaaypaadu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (ஈரசைச் சீர் வாய்பாடுகள்):\n(a) நேர் நேர் - 1. கூவிளம்\n(b) நிரை நேர் - 2. கருவிளம்\n(c) நிரை நிரை - 3. புளிமா\n(d) நேர் நிரை - 4. தேமா", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "B": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "D": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3"}, "explanation": "நேர் நேர் = தேமா (4); நிரை நேர் = புளிமா (3); நிரை நிரை = கருவிளம் (2); நேர் நிரை = கூவிளம் (1). சரியான வரிசை: 4, 3, 2, 1."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the disyllabic metric combinations with their standard mnemonic formulas:\n(a) Ner Ner - 1. Koovilam\n(b) Nirai Ner - 2. Karuvilam\n(c) Nirai Nirai - 3. Pulima\n(d) Ner Nirai - 4. Thema", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "B": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "D": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3"}, "explanation": "Ner Ner -> Thema (4); Nirai Ner -> Pulima (3); Nirai Nirai -> Karuvilam (2); Ner Nirai -> Koovilam (1). Match: 4, 3, 2, 1."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Sa