{"id": "9th-u8-q128", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "adi-seers-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (அடிகள் - சீர்களின் எண்ணிக்கை):\n(a) குரளடி - 1. நான்கு சீர்கள்\n(b) சிந்தடி - 2. ஆறு அல்லது அதற்கு மேற்பட்ட சீர்கள்\n(c) அளவடி (நேரடி) - 3. இரண்டு சீர்கள்\n(d) நெடிலடி - 4. மூன்று சீர்கள்\n(e) கழிநெடிலடி - 5. ஐந்து சீர்கள்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-4, (c)-3, (d)-2, (e)-5", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-5, (d)-1, (e)-4", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-5, (e)-1", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-5, (e)-2"}, "explanation": "குரளடி = 2 சீர்கள் (3); சிந்தடி = 3 சீர்கள் (4); அளவடி = 4 சீர்கள் (1); நெடிலடி = 5 சீர்கள் (5); கழிநெடிலடி = 6 அல்லது அதற்கு மேற்பட்டவை (2). சரியான வரிசை: 3, 4, 1, 5, 2."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the line lengths with their respective foot counts:\n(a) Kuraladi - 1. Four feet\n(b) Chinthadi - 2. Six or more feet\n(c) Alavadi - 3. Two feet\n(d) Nediladi - 4. Three feet\n(e) Kazhinediladi - 5. Five feet", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-4, (c)-3, (d)-2, (e)-5", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-5, (d)-1, (e)-4", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-5, (e)-1", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-5, (e)-2"}, "explanation": "Kuraladi -> 2 feet (3); Chinthadi -> 3 feet (4); Alavadi -> 4 feet (1); Nediladi -> 5 feet (5); Kazhinediladi -> 6+ feet (2). Match: 3, 4, 1, 5, 2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 166, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 166", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "adi", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q129", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thodai-meaning-count", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'தொடை' என்பதன் பொருள் யாது? செய்யுளில் தொடை எத்தனை வகைப்படும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தொடுத்தல்; எட்டு வகைப்படும்", "B": "அளத்தல்; ஐந்து வகைப்படும்", "C": "கூட்டுதல்; நான்கு வகைப்படும்", "D": "பாடல்; ஆறு வகைப்படும்"}, "explanation": "'தொடை' என்றால் 'தொடுத்தல்' (மலர் தொடுப்பது போல ஓசை நயம் படத் தொடுத்தல்) என்று பொருள். இது மோனை, எதுகை, இயைபு, அளபெடை, முரண், இரட்டை, அந்தாதி, செந்தொடை என எட்டு வகைப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What does 'Thodai' literally mean, and how many types of Thodai exist in poetics?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Strung together / Garlanded (தொடுத்தல்); Eight types (எட்டு வகை)", "B": "Measuring; Five types", "C": "Adding; Four types", "D": "Singing; Six types"}, "explanation": "'Thodai' means weaving or garlanding harmonic phonetic patterns, encompassing eight canonical types."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 166, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 166", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "thodai", "definition"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q130", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "monai-thodai-definition", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடலின் அடிகளிலோ அல்லது சீர்களிலோ 'முதலெழுத்து ஒன்றி வரத் தொடுப்பது' எவ்வகைத் தொடை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "எதுகைத் தொடை", "B": "மோனைத் தொடை", "C": "இயைபுத் தொடை", "D": "முரண் தொடை"}, "explanation": "பாடலில் அடிகள்தோறும் அல்லது சீர்கள்தோறும் முதல் எழுத்து ஒன்றி வரத் தொடுப்பது 'மோனைத் தொடை' எனப்படும். (எ.கா: ஆக்குவது - அறத்தை - ஆக்குக)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "When the initial letter (Mudhal Ezhuthu) harmonizes identically across lines or feet, what rhyme is formed?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Edhugai Thodai", "B": "Monai Thodai (மோனைத் தொடை - Alliteration)", "C": "Iyaibu Thodai", "D": "Muran Thodai"}, "explanation": "Monai constitutes head-rhyme or alliteration matching the opening letters."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 166, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 166", "url": null, "s