{"id": "9th-u8-q131", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "edhugai-thodai-definition", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "முதல் எழுத்து அளவொத்து நிற்க, அடிகளிலோ சீர்களிலோ 'இரண்டாம் எழுத்து ஒன்றி அமைவது' எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மோனைத் தொடை", "B": "இயைபுத் தொடை", "C": "எதுகைத் தொடை", "D": "அந்தாதித் தொடை"}, "explanation": "முதல் எழுத்தின் மாத்திரை அளவு ஒத்திருக்க, இரண்டாம் எழுத்து ஒன்றி வரத் தொடுப்பது 'எதுகைத் தொடை' எனப்படும். (எ.கா: ஆக்குவது - போக்குவது)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "When the second letter matches across lines with initial vowels of identical length, what is it called?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Monai Thodai", "B": "Iyaibu Thodai", "C": "Edhugai Thodai (எதுகைத் தொடை - Second-letter assonance / Rhyme)", "D": "Anthathi Thodai"}, "explanation": "Edhugai is second-letter rhyme under equal initial prosodic vowel quantities."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 166, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 166", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "edhugai", "definition"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q132", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "iyaibu-thodai-definition", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அடிகள்தோறும் அல்லது சீர்கள்தோறும் 'இறுதி எழுத்தோ, அசையோ, சீரோ ஒன்றி அமைவது' எவ்வகைத் தொடை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மோனை", "B": "எதுகை", "C": "முரண்", "D": "இயைபுத் தொடை"}, "explanation": "அடிகளின் இறுதி எழுத்தோ, அசையோ, சீரோ ஒன்றி வரத் தொடுப்பது 'இயைபுத் தொடை' எனப்படும். (எ.கா: வாருங்கள் - தாருங்கள்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "When the terminal letters, syllables, or words harmonize across successive lines, what rhyme is formed?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Monai", "B": "Edhugai", "C": "Muran", "D": "Iyaibu Thodai (இயைபுத் தொடை - End-rhyme)"}, "explanation": "Iyaibu corresponds to end-rhyme where line conclusions echo identical phonetic endings."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 166, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 166", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previo