{"id": "9th-u8-q135", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thirukkural-seer-alagu-perithu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"காலத்தினால் செய்த நன்றி சிறிதெனினும் / ஞாலத்தின் மாணப் பெரிது\" - இக்குறட்பாவின் இறுதிச் சீரான 'பெரிது' என்பதன் வாய்பாடு யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நாள் (நேர்)", "B": "மலர் (நிரை)", "C": "பிறப்பு (நிரைபு)", "D": "காசு (நேர்பு)"}, "explanation": "'பெரிது' = பெ(குறில்)+ரி(குறில்) = நிரை; து(குற்றியலுகரம்) சேர்ந்ததால் 'நிரைபு'. நிரைபு என்பதன் வாய்பாடு 'பிறப்பு' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the Kural couplet ending with the word 'பெரிது' (Perithu), what is the metrical formula of this final foot?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Naal (Ner)", "B": "Malar (Nirai)", "C": "Pirappu (Niraibu - நிரைபு / பிறப்பு)", "D": "Kaasu (Nerbu)"}, "explanation": "'Pe-ri' (two short vowels = Nirai) + 'thu' (short 'u' = 'bu'), forming Niraibu whose formula is 'Pirappu'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 167, "chapter": null, "secti